'''Swordsman Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]]. It was added in [[Version 2.0 Update#Version 2.0.5 Update|Version 2.0.5]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 5.2 Update|Version 5.2]] greatly increases his health and attack power. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 8.2 Update|Version 8.2]]. In [[The Battle Cats POP!]], Swordsman Cat is unlocked into the Rare Capsule pool once clearing [[Saudi Arabia (Empire of Cats)|Saudi Arabia]].

